{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-201199-r4511900","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Barbecue Chicken","sourcePageId":201199,"sourceRevision":"4511900","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-18T02:15:25Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Barbecue%20Chicken&oldid=4511900","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:24:40.533Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Barbecue recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Grilled recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using cayenne","Category:Recipes using chicken","Category:Recipes using chicken broth and stock","Category:Recipes using dark brown sugar","Category:Recipes using honey","Category:Recipes using lemon zest","Category:Recipes using paprika","Category:Recipes using pepper","Category:Recipes using rosemary","Category:Recipes using thyme","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"bac492a791c0cbcafc13e3bffc3a1730fc72042d226b5c9a3f9ea93f28edac2e","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Chicken recipes\n| Difficulty = 2\n| Image = [[File:Barbecue chicken-03.jpg|300px]]\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n== Ingredients ==\n\n* 2 each [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken]] thighs, legs, and breasts\n\n=== Brine ===\n\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Quart|quart]] water\n* ½ cup dark [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* 4 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], minced\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] finely grated lemon zest\n* 1 quart salt-free [[Cookbook:Chicken Broth|chicken broth]]\n\n=== Sauce ===\n\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Tomato Paste|tomato paste]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* ¼ cup apple [[Cookbook:Cider Vinegar|cider vinegar]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n\n=== Rub ===\n\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* 2 tbsp smoked paprika\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] dried [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]]\n* 1 ½ tsp dried [[Cookbook:Thyme|thyme]]\n* 1 ½ tbsp [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n* ½ tbsp coarsely-ground [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 2 tbsp dark brown sugar\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine all brine ingredients in a 2-[[Cookbook:Gallon|gallon]] zip-top bag. Insert chicken and refrigerate for 2 hours.\n#Combine sauce ingredients and bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] over medium high heat until reduced by half.\n#Quickly swab the [[Cookbook:Grill|grill]] with an oiled towel tied with twine to lube.\n#Combine Rub ingredients and massage all over chicken. Refrigerate for 30 minutes.\n#Grill chicken over a preheated charcoal grill, turning often, for 10 minutes. Cook, turning often and brushing with sauce when turned, until internal temperature reaches 165°F in the breast and 170°F for the dark meat.\n#Cover with foil and let rest 7 minutes. Meanwhile, boil remaining sauce for 5 minutes and place in a squirt bottle. Serve chicken with sauce on the side.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Barbecue recipes]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using paprika]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rosemary]]\n[[Category:Recipes using thyme]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken broth and stock]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon zest]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Barbecue Chicken","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 each chicken thighs, legs, and breasts","sourceText":"2 each chicken thighs, legs, and breasts","amountText":"2 each chicken thighs, legs, and breasts","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Combine all brine ingredients in a 2-gallon zip-top bag. Insert chicken and refrigerate for 2 hours.","sourceText":"Combine all brine ingredients in a 2-gallon zip-top bag. Insert chicken and refrigerate for 2 hours.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Combine sauce ingredients and bring to a boil over medium high heat until reduced by half.","sourceText":"Combine sauce ingredients and bring to a boil over medium high heat until reduced by half.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":3,"text":"Quickly swab the grill with an oiled towel tied with twine to lube.","sourceText":"Quickly swab the grill with an oiled towel tied with twine to lube.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":4,"text":"Combine Rub ingredients and massage all over chicken. Refrigerate for 30 minutes.","sourceText":"Combine Rub ingredients and massage all over chicken. Refrigerate for 30 minutes.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":5,"text":"Grill chicken over a preheated charcoal grill, turning often, for 10 minutes. Cook, turning often and brushing with sauce when turned, until internal temperature reaches 165°F in the breast and 170°F for the dark meat.","sourceText":"Grill chicken over a preheated charcoal grill, turning often, for 10 minutes. Cook, turning often and brushing with sauce when turned, until internal temperature reaches 165°F in the breast and 170°F for the dark meat.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":6,"text":"Cover with foil and let rest 7 minutes. Meanwhile, boil remaining sauce for 5 minutes and place in a squirt bottle. Serve chicken with sauce on the side.","sourceText":"Cover with foil and let rest 7 minutes. Meanwhile, boil remaining sauce for 5 minutes and place in a squirt bottle. Serve chicken with sauce on the side.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:201199","recordId":"wikibooks-201199-r4511900","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4511900","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Barbecue%20Chicken&oldid=4511900","sourceSha256":"bac492a791c0cbcafc13e3bffc3a1730fc72042d226b5c9a3f9ea93f28edac2e","parserVersion":"wikibooks-sections-v3","quantityParserVersion":"source-prefix-v2","license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"reviewStatus":"source-extracted-unreviewed","changeNotice":"Source-language section extraction; markup removed. Not culinarily reviewed, translated or runtime-approved.","recipe":{"name